OL,3,AWhy UK diesel prices have hit an
OL,4,Aall-time high
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe price of diesel in the UK has hit
OL,7,Fan all-time high, as the fallout from
OL,8,Fthe US-Israel war with Iran continues
OL,9,Fto drive up costs.
OL,11,FThe average price of a litre of diesel
OL,12,Fat the pump stands at 199.18p,
OL,13,Faccording to the RAC motoring body. The
OL,14,Fprevious record was 199.09p, recorded
OL,15,Fon 25 June 2022, following Russia's
OL,16,Ffull-scale invasion of Ukraine earlier
OL,17,Fthat year.
OL,23,APub: 02-MarQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
