OL,3,AWhy UK diesel prices have hit an
OL,4,Aall-time high
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver the past seven months, the Iran
OL,7,Fwar has severely disrupted the
OL,8,Fproduction and transportation of
OL,9,Fwholesale oil across the region,
OL,10,Fcausing the price of fuels made from
OL,11,Fcrude to surge.
OL,13,FMotor fuel prices fell back when the US
OL,14,Fand Iran agreed in June to a framework
OL,15,Fdeal to end the fighting, but rose
OL,16,Fagain as tensions resurfaced.
